{"seq":3,"slug":"point-free-style","title":"Point-free 风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/point-free-style","wordCount":794,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"point-free-风格\">Point-free 风格</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Point-free 风格</strong>（Tacit Programming）省略显式参数，直接用函数组合定义新函数。它把视角从&quot;数据怎么流动&quot;提升到&quot;函数怎么拼接&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointed</td>\n<td>显式声明参数</td>\n<td><code>const f = (x) =&gt; g(h(x))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Point-free</td>\n<td>省略参数、直接组合</td>\n<td><code>const f = compose(g, h)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优势</td>\n<td>减少命名噪音、突出组合关系、促进复用</td>\n<td>简单组合场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>陷阱</td>\n<td>过度抽象导致 Pointless、可读性下降</td>\n<td><code>(.) . (.)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具函数</td>\n<td>支撑 Point-free 的基础设施</td>\n<td><code>identity</code> / <code>constant</code> / <code>flip</code> / <code>prop</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心判断标准不是&quot;能不能去掉参数&quot;，而是&quot;去掉之后是否更好懂&quot;——可读性优先于简洁性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-point-free\">什么是 Point-free</h2><p><strong>Point-free 风格</strong>（Tacit Programming）是一种省略显式参数声明的编程风格。&quot;Point&quot; 在这里指的不是小数点，而是数学中的&quot;点&quot;——即函数参数。Point-free 风格通过函数组合直接定义函数，而不提及其参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Pointed（显式参数）&#10;sum&#39; :: [Int] -&gt; Int&#10;sum&#39; xs = foldr (+) 0 xs&#10;&#10;-- Point-free（省略参数）&#10;sum&#39; :: [Int] -&gt; Int&#10;sum&#39; = foldr (+) 0&#10;&#10;-- Pointed&#10;isEven :: Int -&gt; Bool&#10;isEven n = n `mod` 2 == 0&#10;&#10;-- Point-free&#10;isEven :: Int -&gt; Bool&#10;isEven = (== 0) . (`mod` 2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Pointed（显式参数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum' :: [Int] -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum' xs = foldr (+) 0 xs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Point-free（省略参数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum' :: [Int] -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum' = foldr (+) 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Pointed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>isEven :: Int -> Bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>isEven n = n `mod` 2 == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Point-free</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>isEven :: Int -> Bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>isEven = (== 0) . (`mod` 2)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];&#10;&#10;const sumPointed = (xs: number[]): number =&gt; xs.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);&#10;&#10;const add = (a: number, b: number): number =&gt; a + b;&#10;const sumPointFree = (xs: number[]): number =&gt; xs.reduce(add, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> numbers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumPointed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">xs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumPointFree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">xs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(add, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>定义方式</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointed</td>\n<td><code>const f = (x) =&gt; g(h(x))</code></td>\n<td>数据如何流经函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Point-free</td>\n<td><code>const f = compose(g, h)</code></td>\n<td>函数如何组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Pointed 风格&quot;&#10;        X1[&quot;x&quot;] --&gt; H1[&quot;h(x)&quot;] --&gt; G1[&quot;g(h(x))&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Point-free 风格&quot;&#10;        H2[&quot;h&quot;] --&gt;|compose| G2[&quot;g&quot;]&#10;        COMP[&quot;g ∘ h&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Pointed 风格\"\n        X1[\"x\"] --&gt; H1[\"h(x)\"] --&gt; G1[\"g(h(x))\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Point-free 风格\"\n        H2[\"h\"] --&gt;|compose| G2[\"g\"]\n        COMP[\"g ∘ h\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Point-free 风格的本质是将关注点从&quot;数据变换的步骤&quot;提升到&quot;函数间的关系&quot;。它不是目标本身，而是函数组合自然产生的结果。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"point-free-的优势\">Point-free 的优势</h2><p>Point-free 风格在适当使用时可以显著提升代码的抽象层次和可读性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Pointed：命名噪音多&#10;averageAge :: [Person] -&gt; Double&#10;averageAge people = sum (map age people) / fromIntegral (length people)&#10;&#10;-- Point-free：关注数据流&#10;averageAge :: [Person] -&gt; Double&#10;averageAge = liftA2 (/) (sum . map age) (fromIntegral . length)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Pointed：命名噪音多</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>averageAge :: [Person] -> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>averageAge people = sum (map age people) / fromIntegral (length people)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Point-free：关注数据流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>averageAge :: [Person] -> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>averageAge = liftA2 (/) (sum . map age) (fromIntegral . length)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const not = (b: boolean): boolean =&gt; !b;&#10;const isOdd = (n: number): boolean =&gt; n % 2 !== 0;&#10;&#10;const getEvenNumbers = (xs: number[]): number[] =&gt; xs.filter((x) =&gt; !isOdd(x));&#10;&#10;const getEvenNumbersPF = (xs: number[]): number[] =&gt; xs.filter(compose(not, isOdd));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isOdd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getEvenNumbers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">xs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isOdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getEvenNumbersPF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">xs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(not, isOdd));</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减少命名负担</td>\n<td>不需要为中间参数起名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突出数据流</td>\n<td>直接看到函数间的组合关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促进复用</td>\n<td>自然产出可复用的函数组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对齐数学直觉</td>\n<td>更接近数学中的函数定义方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩短定义</td>\n<td>去掉冗余的参数声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Point-free 促进的思维模式&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;识别操作&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;拆分为原子函数&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;通过组合连接&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;得到声明式定义&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Point-free 促进的思维模式\"\n        A[\"识别操作\"] --&gt; B[\"拆分为原子函数\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"通过组合连接\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"得到声明式定义\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"point-free-的陷阱\">Point-free 的陷阱</h2><p>过度使用 Point-free 会导致代码变得晦涩难懂，这被社区戏称为 <strong>Pointless 风格</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 清晰的 Point-free&#10;map :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; [a] -&gt; [b]&#10;&#10;-- 过度 Point-free（Pointless）&#10;-- 原始：\\f g x -&gt; f (g x)&#10;-- Point-free：(.) . (.)&#10;-- 含义已完全不透明\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 清晰的 Point-free</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map :: (a -> b) -> [a] -> [b]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 过度 Point-free（Pointless）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 原始：\\f g x -> f (g x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Point-free：(.) . (.)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 含义已完全不透明</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const getName = (user: { name: string }): string =&gt; user.name;&#10;&#10;const getNamesPF = compose(&#10;  (xs: string[]) =&gt; xs.join(&#39;, &#39;),&#10;  (users: { name: string }[]) =&gt; users.map(getName),&#10;);&#10;&#10;const getNamesReadable = (users: { name: string }[]): string =&gt; users.map((u) =&gt; u.name).join(&#39;, &#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8F