td>谓词取反</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"从-pointed-到-point-free-的重构\">从 Pointed 到 Point-free 的重构</h2><p>将 Pointed 代码转换为 Point-free 是一个渐进的过程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const users = [&#10;  { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 30 },&#10;  { name: &#39;Bob&#39;, age: 25 },&#10;  { name: &#39;Charlie&#39;, age: 35 },&#10;];&#10;&#10;const getAdultNames1 = (users: { name: string; age: number }[]) =&gt; users.filter((u) =&gt; u.age &gt;= 18).map((u) =&gt; u.name);&#10;&#10;const isAdult = (u: { age: number }): boolean =&gt; u.age &gt;= 18;&#10;const getName = (u: { name: string }): string =&gt; u.name;&#10;&#10;const getAdultNames2 = (users: { name: string; age: number }[]) =&gt; users.filter(isAdult).map(getName);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { na